  "notes": "{差|さ}し{替|か}える is commonly used in business and media contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {写真|しゃしん}を{差|さ}し{替|か}える: to replace a photo\n- {資料|しりょう}を{差|さ}し{替|か}える: to replace documents\n- {人員|じんいん}を{差|さ}し{替|か}える: to replace personnel\n- {差|さ}し{替|か}え{版|ばん}: replacement version\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {入|い}れ{替|か}える: to switch, to interchange\n- {取|と}り{替|か}える: to exchange, to replace\n- {交換|こうかん}する: to exchange",
